---
import MainLayout from '../layouts/MainLayout.astro';
---

<MainLayout title="About me">
    <div class="h-full w-full xl:w-1/2 md:w-2/3 p-4 md:p-8 text-content bg-e6n-black light-mode:bg-white">
        <h1 class="text-white light-mode:text-gray-800 text-4xl italic mb-4">About me</h1>
        <p class="pb-3 text-white light-mode:text-gray-800 text-xl">I'm Luka Peharda, a software engineer from Varaždin, Croatia. I've been building for the web since 2007.</p>
        <p class="pb-3 text-white light-mode:text-gray-800 text-xl">For the last 13 years I've worked at Creative 6 Media on two SaaS products. <a href="https://kourses.com/" class="border-b border-e6n-red hover:bg-e6n-red" target="_blank">Kourses</a> is a course, community and membership platform I built from whiteboard to production and still own. Before it became my main focus I built the licensing and payments platform behind <a href="https://optimizepress.com/" class="border-b border-e6n-blue hover:bg-e6n-blue" target="_blank">OptimizePress</a> - 30,000+ customers over its lifetime, 70M requests a month and nearly $8M processed through Stripe.</p>
        <p class="pb-3 text-white light-mode:text-gray-800 text-xl">I have never been able to just take a ticket and build it. I want to know where the request came from and how we will know it worked. So I talk to customers, handle support escalations and check the numbers after we ship.</p>
        <p class="pb-3 text-white light-mode:text-gray-800 text-xl">Outside of work I help run <a href="https://www.meetup.com/en-AU/Devz-Meetup-Vara%C5%BEdin/" target="_blank" class="border-b border-e6n-green hover:bg-e6n-green">Devz Meetup Varaždin</a>, volunteer at <a href="https://makerspace.hr/" target="_blank" class="border-b border-e6n-blue hover:bg-e6n-blue">Makerspace Varaždin</a>, speak at <a href="/talks/" class="border-b border-e6n-red hover:bg-e6n-red">conferences</a> and build <a class="border-b border-e6n-yellow hover:bg-e6n-yellow" href="/projects/">side projects</a>. I read a lot and listen to podcasts, so take a look at my <a class="border-b border-e6n-green hover:bg-e6n-green" href="/recommendations/">recommendations</a>.</p>
        <p class="pb-3 text-white light-mode:text-gray-800 text-xl">Programming is more than work for me. It is a calling :-) A way to express myself creatively and to build something that potentially a lot of people will use. I won't lie, it can be frustrating. There are good and bad days. But more often than not it is exceptionally fulfilling.</p>
    </div>
</MainLayout>
